","hair-repair-mask",{"title":470,"slug":471},"8. Sleep earbuds (31","sleep-earbuds",{"title":473,"slug":474},"9. Hard water shower filter (20","hard-water-shower-filter",{"title":476,"slug":477},"10. Hair texture powder (104","hair-texture-powder",{"title":479,"slug":480},"11. Vanity bag (66","vanity-bag",{"title":482,"slug":483},"12. Electric pepper grinder (32","electric-pepper-grinder",{"title":485,"slug":486},"How to find trending products","how-to-find-trending-products",{"title":488,"meta_title":489,"meta_description":490,"short_title":491,"slug":492,"full_slug":493,"index":291,"order":494,"sections":495},"Google Trends FAQ","Google Trends FAQ - Everything to know about Google Trends","Google Trends FAQ and Guide: Learn about search data, interpretation, usage tips, and how to access absolute search volume for in-depth analysis.","FAQ","faq","/google-trends/faq/",23,[496,499,502,505,508,511,514,517,520,523,526,529,532,535,538,541,544,547,550,553,556,559,562,565,568,571,574,577,580,583,586,589,592],{"title":497,"slug":498},"What is Google Trends?","what-is-google-trends",{"title":500,"slug":501},"How does it work?","how-does-it-work",{"title":503,"slug":504},"Understanding the data","understanding-the-data",{"title":506,"slug":507},"How is the data adjusted?","how-is-the-data-adjusted",{"title":509,"slug":510},"What does \"breakout\" mean?","what-does-breakout-mean",{"title":512,"slug":513},"What does \"rising\" mean?","what-does-rising-mean",{"title":515,"slug":516},"Hot Searches in Google Trends","hot-searches-in-google-trends",{"title":518,"slug":519},"Can you filter by demographic?","can-you-filter-by-demographic",{"title":521,"slug":522},"How to see Google Trends by age","how-to-see-google-trends-by-age",{"title":524,"slug":525},"What is the dotted line?","what-is-the-dotted-line",{"title":527,"slug":528},"Why does the data change?","why-does-the-data-change",{"title":530,"slug":531},"What time zone is it in?","what-time-zone-is-it-in",{"title":533,"slug"